@UPMS.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Login (admin seed)
POST {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@upms.local",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Register a passenger
POST {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@upms.local",
  "password": "Student@123",
  "fullName": "Demo Student"
}

### List routes (paste the token)
GET {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List trips
GET {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a route (Admin)
POST {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "JS-02",
  "name": "Campus to Kotri",
  "active": true
}

### Login (passenger seed)
POST {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@upms.local",
  "password": "Student@123"
}

### Create an online booking (Passenger)
POST {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripId": "{{tripId}}",
  "method": 0
}

### Create a cash booking (Passenger)
POST {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripId": "{{tripId}}",
  "method": 1
}

### My bookings (Passenger)
GET {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

### All bookings (Admin)
GET {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel a booking
POST {{UPMS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
